      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUX AETERNA (8) was very good against a top field last week, finishing fourth to Captains Mistress. Draws wider but will enjoy the return to her own sex and was racing well prior with a string of wins and placings including a victory in the Norms Daughter Stakes from the outside barrier. WICKED CONFESSION (3) bumped into a smart one when runner-up at Melton last week and placed in the Vicbred Super Series 4M Final prior. Scored a win and placed in the Queen Elizabeth II Mile in her last Sydney raid. Big chance from a good draw. GUNNA RELOAD (7) makes her first appearance since a second to Dangerous at Wagga in May. Owns a good fresh record and strikes at 50 per cent at this circuit and distance. GOLLY GEE FELLAS (6) will enjoy the return to mares grade having recorded a dominant win at this circuit and distance last month. IDEAL MOTH (1) has joined Jason Grimson since she won at Kilmore last month. Keep safe from the ace draw.",
